<title>USA: Medex receives contract from Premier.</title>
<headline>Medex receives contract from Premier.</headline>
<dateline>HILLIARD, Ohio 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medex Inc said Monday that it was awarded a contract from Premier Inc, a large health care alliance enterprise for hospitals nationwide.</p>
<p>In a release Monday, Medex said that the five-year contract allows it to supply products to nearly 1,800 hospitals and health care systems affiliated with Premier.</p>
<p>Medex said the contract takes effect February 1, 1997.</p>
</text>
